                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/releases/tag/14.1.1"&gt;14.2.0: Add `bool NavigatingFromEventArgs.IsDestinationPageACommunityToolkitPopupPage()` Extension Method, Fix `StatusBar` + `SpeechToText` Auto-timeout bugs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;&lt;code&gt;CommunityToolkit.Maui v14.2.0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;New Popup Extension&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight highlight-source-cs notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="public static bool IsDestinationPageACommunityToolkitPopupPage(this NavigatingFromEventArgs args);"&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span class="pl-k"&gt;public&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-k"&gt;&lt;span class="pl-k"&gt;static&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-smi"&gt;bool&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-en"&gt;IsDestinationPageACommunityToolkitPopupPage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-k"&gt;this&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-smi"&gt;NavigatingFromEventArgs&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;args&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can now use &lt;code&gt;NavigatingFromEventArgs&lt;/code&gt; to determine if the previous page was a &lt;code&gt;Popup&lt;/code&gt;: &lt;a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/communitytoolkit/maui/views/popup#lifecycle-behavior" rel="nofollow"&gt;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/communitytoolkit/maui/views/popup#lifecycle-behavior&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight highlight-source-cs notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="protected override void OnNavigatingFrom(NavigatingFromEventArgs args)
{
    base.OnNavigatingFrom(args);
    if (args.IsDestinationPageACommunityToolkitPopupPage())
    {
        // If true, `OnNavigatingFrom` was called by starting a Popup
    }
}"&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;span class="pl-k"&gt;protected&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-k"&gt;override&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-smi"&gt;void&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-en"&gt;OnNavigatingFrom&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-smi"&gt;NavigatingFromEventArgs&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;args&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="pl-k"&gt;base&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-en"&gt;OnNavigatingFrom&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;args&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="pl-k"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-s1"&gt;args&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-en"&gt;IsDestinationPageACommunityToolkitPopupPage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class="pl-c"&gt;// If true, `OnNavigatingFrom` was called by starting a Popup&lt;/span&gt;
    &lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="pl-kos"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;SpeechToText Bug Fix&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix AutoStopSilenceTimeout for SpeechToTextOptions doesn't work on iOS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;StatusBar Bug Fix&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix &lt;code&gt;StatusBar.SetColor()&lt;/code&gt; when using &lt;code&gt;StatusBarBehavior&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update StatusBar Size On Device Orientation Change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added OnNavigatingFrom extension for popup related navigation  by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/dartasen/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/dartasen"&gt;@dartasen&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3947179221" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3099" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3099/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3099"&gt;#3099&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove &lt;code&gt;RestartTimer()&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;AvAudioNode&lt;/code&gt; Callback by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TheCodeTraveler/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TheCodeTraveler"&gt;@TheCodeTraveler&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4240674014" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3196" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3196/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3196"&gt;#3196&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FIX: [BUG] Using StatusBarBehavior Breaks StatusBar.SetColor() &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4246511985" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3197" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3197/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3197"&gt;#3197&lt;/a&gt; API36 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Pastajello/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Pastajello"&gt;@Pastajello&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4266861665" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3202" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3202/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3202"&gt;#3202&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add compile-time property initializer for default values in BindableProperty source generator by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/matt-goldman/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/matt-goldman"&gt;@matt-goldman&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4289057094" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3204" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3204/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3204"&gt;#3204&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update StatusBar Size On Device Orientation Change by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TheCodeTraveler/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TheCodeTraveler"&gt;@TheCodeTraveler&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4304329642" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/issues/3208" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3208/hovercard" href="https://github.com/CommunityToolkit/Maui/pull/3208"&gt;#3208&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
